xt","block_id":"ldiUa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91f4a2f6-ebe6-4ec0-b949-2ebe14311fbe","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"気になる、おそらく他の人では分からないでしょうからdein.vimのissue作ってください","ts":"1631351980.329900","thread_ts":"1631343572.326800","parent_user_id":"U01R5R36QK0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vivh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ba1e089-ea9f-4865-afc9-b3898fa7d40f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"この現象はLSPに依存するので再現方法をちゃんと書くようにしてください","ts":"1631352021.330100","thread_ts":"1631343572.326800","parent_user_id":"U01R5R36QK0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dHCWo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c6ceab2-12b9-4587-99e7-3b8fda5999d1","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"了解です。","ts":"1631353386.330400","thread_ts":"1631343572.326800","parent_user_id":"U01R5R36QK0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ctNf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"250b7471-9b6d-42c0-96a6-a91543699d9d","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/issues/427\u003e 立てました。よろしくおねがいします。","ts":"1631362684.330700","thread_ts":"1631343572.326800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"778x846px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/issues/427|#427 Lazy loading previm breaks lightline.vim when displaying function information by LSP\u003e","text":"*Problems summary*\n\nLazy loading previm breaks lightline.vim when displaying function information by LSP.\n\n*Expected*\n\nlightline.vim show mode, filetype etc always.\n\n*Environment Information (Required!)*\n\n• dein.vim version(SHA1): \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/commit/ee6a5fcecb1c5da6976f8e7dc65cf7a14b48fe14|ee6a5fc\u003e\n• OS: Manjaro\n• Vim/neovim version: NVIM v0.6.0-dev+43-g02bf251bb\n\n*Provide a minimal .vimrc with less than 50 lines (Required!)*\n\n(`init.vim`)\n\n```\nset runtimepath^=~/.config/nvim/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/dein.vim/\nif dein#load_state('~/.config/nvim/dein')\n  call dein#begin('~/.config/nvim/dein')\n  call dein#add('prabirshrestha/vim-lsp')\n  call dein#add('mattn/vim-lsp-settings')\n  call dein#add('itchyny/lightline.vim')\n  call dein#add('previm/previm', {'lazy': 1, 'on_ft': 'markdown'})\n  call dein#end()\n  call dein#save_state()\nendif\nset laststatus=2\n```\n\nNote: If set previm to \"non-lazy\", this problem does not occur.\n\n*The reproduce ways from Vim starting (Required!)*\n\n1. `:call dein#install()`\n2. Restart vim and execute `:set filetype=python`.\n3. execute `:LspInstallServer pylsp-all` for install Langage server.\n4. execute `:edit foo.py` and write `print(`. The function information will be displayed.\n5. At the same time, mode, filetype etc is disappear.\n\nNote: This problem also occurs with other file types and language server combinations. For example, `foo.ts` and `deno`.\n\n*Screen shot (if possible)*\n\nIt is a gif after step 2.\n\n\u003chttps://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966|https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966\u003e","image_url":"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9e180047a2638af5dbc305e6b00fe31791b8e86ef8bd294d92cc066d3db29f70/68747470733a2f2f692e6779617a6f2e636f6d2f35353064616338633836613034323631633630313761303661373563356439392e676966","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim|Shougo/dein.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631362650}],"parent_user_id":"U01R5R36QK0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=HwV"}]}]
